{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Bucketing","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bucketing","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"enum","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxFeatureFlags"}],"title":"Bucketing","externalID":"s:18SwiduxFeatureFlags9BucketingO"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxfeatureflags\/bucketing"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Type Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/Bucketing\/bucket(id:flagKey:)","doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/Bucketing\/isInRollout(bucket:rollout:)","doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/Bucketing\/variantIndex(bucket:weights:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/documentation\/SwiduxFeatureFlags\/Bucketing","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pure functions for stable feature-flag bucketing."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bucketing","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A bucket is the 32-bit FNV-1a hash of the UTF-8 bytes of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"id + \":\" + flagKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", passed through murmur3’s "},{"code":"fmix32","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" finalizer and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"taken modulo 10,000. Rollout and weight percentages cover 100 buckets per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"point, so a 1% rollout is buckets ","type":"text"},{"code":"0..<100","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The same input always","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"produces the same bucket.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The finalizer keeps one ID’s buckets for different flags independent, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"two flags’ small cohorts overlap at the rate chance predicts. Without it,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the low bits of an FNV-1a hash depend only on the low bits of the input","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bytes, and one flag’s bucket partly determines another’s.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is not GrowthBook’s bucketing (different input layout, finalizer,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and string encoding), so buckets don’t carry over from GrowthBook.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Changing this function re-buckets every user and reshuffles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every running experiment, so it changes only in a major release."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxFeatureFlags/documentation/SwiduxFeatureFlags/Bucketing/bucket(id:flagKey:)":{"type":"topic","title":"bucket(id:flagKey:)","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bucket","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"flagKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdent